:: AGA-LWpos/pov {"position":"650,250","size":"100,100"}
''Liam'':
“Mommmm can we pleaseeee go outside? I’m sooo booooored!” 
-
You turn around to see your two children, Sam and Liam, behind you.
-
''Sam'':
“I promise we’ll be good!”
-
''You'':
//(Didn’t they just upgrade that preserve nearby?)//
-
''You'':
“Okay, but Mommy gets to decide where we go.”
-
You round them up into the car and go to the preserve. Once you arrive, there are 3 paths. The left path appears to lead to a cove, the middle path appears to be an easy path, and the right path looks more difficult.
-
''Sam:''
“ Let’s go to the left.”
-
''Liam:''
“But, I want to go on the right path!” 
-
(text-style:"underline")[What path do you choose?]

[[Left Path->Left Path]] - [[Middle Path->Middle Path]] - [[Right Path->Right Path]]


:: Left Path {"position":"525,425","size":"100,100"}
You: 
“Let’s go down the left path!”
-
You walk past many Ashe Juniper trees.
-
Liam:
“Mommy, do you see that? What is it?”
-
Your youngest points to a bird in a tree.
-
[[Look at it. ->Look at it]]



:: Look at it {"position":"650,650","size":"100,100"}
You: 
“It’s a Golden Cheek Warbler!”

It is a species that is highly endangered because of the rapid urban expansion. It relies on the Ashe Juniper tree for nesting materials.



